## 7. Troubleshooting

| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Backend import errors on numbered folders | Check Python is 3.10+; the importlib pattern requires it |
| `createdb: command not found` | Use pgAdmin or `psql -U postgres -c "CREATE DATABASE roadwatch;"` |
| Flutter can't reach backend | Check `kBaseUrl` in `1_constants.dart`; confirm port 8000 is open |
| YOLO download fails | Manually download `yolov8n.pt` from Ultralytics releases and place in `2_backend/` |
| Severity always "Low" | Expected with generic weights — see YOLO fine-tuning guide |
| GPS fails on emulator | Android Studio → Extended Controls → Location → set mock coordinates |
